/* Oracle: drives the REAL suricata radix4/radix6 AddKey/FindBestMatch code,
 * mirroring SCHInfoAddHostOSInfo / SCHInfoGetHostOSFlavour.
 *
 * Protocol on stdin:
 *   A <flavour> <addr-or-range>   -> add (prints "ok <v>" / "err <reason>")
 *   L <ip>                        -> lookup (prints flavour name or "none")
 *   Q                             -> quit
